NewIsland_Text_MeowthReadsFiles::
    .string "MEOWTH: “Project M”… M-1… M-2…\n"
    .string "Dis is where dey made MEWTWO!$"

NewIsland_Text_JessieBossWillPay::
    .string "JESSIE: Every last file goes to\n"
    .string "the boss! We'll be promoted for\l"
    .string "sure this time!$"

NewIsland_Text_MeowthTwerpFollowedUs::
    .string "MEOWTH: Da twerp and dat PIKACHU!\n"
    .string "Dey followed us all da way here?!$"

NewIsland_Text_JamesMagikarpEvolved::
    .string "JAMES: And this time I have a\n"
    .string "secret weapon! My MAGIKARP\l"
    .string "finally evolved!$"

NewIsland_Text_RocketFinalIntro::
    .string "JESSIE & JAMES: This island's\n"
    .string "secrets belong to TEAM ROCKET!$"

NewIsland_Text_RocketFinalDefeat::
    .string "JAMES: Even GYARADOS couldn't\n"
    .string "stop that PIKACHU…$"

NewIsland_Text_JessieAfterFinal::
    .string "JESSIE: Fine! Keep your dusty old\n"
    .string "lab! We're done chasing ghosts!$"

NewIsland_Text_MeowthAfterFinal::
    .string "MEOWTH: …But I'll say dis much.\n"
    .string "Dat PIKACHU's da real deal.$"

NewIsland_Text_SomethingFluttered::
    .string "Something fluttered down to the\n"
    .string "floor where TEAM ROCKET stood.$"

NewIsland_Text_CargoTagReads::
    .string "It's an old tag from a shipping\n"
    .string "crate. It reads:\p"
    .string "“M - VERMILION - FRAGILE”$"

NewIsland_Text_Log1::
    .string "It's a research log.\p"
    .string "“A hair of the jungle POKéMON MEW\n"
    .string "reached this island today.\p"
    .string "Our first copy, M-1, cannot keep\n"
    .string "its shape. It melts into a pink\l"
    .string "mass that copies what it sees.\p"
    .string "We sent it to the MANSION lab on\n"
    .string "CINNABAR for study.”$"

NewIsland_Text_Log2::
    .string "It's a research log.\p"
    .string "“M-2 is complete. It is far\n"
    .string "stronger than MEW itself, and it\l"
    .string "hates us for making it.\p"
    .string "The lab is to be closed. The last\n"
    .string "sample of M goes by boat tonight,\l"
    .string "sealed in a crate.\p"
    .string "A truck will carry it from the\n"
    .string "VERMILION quay to a warehouse.”$"

NewIsland_Text_Log3::
    .string "It's the last research log.\p"
    .string "“The truck never left the quay.\n"
    .string "The crate was found open,\l"
    .string "and empty.\p"
    .string "The driver swears that when he\n"
    .string "parked, something small and pink\l"
    .string "curled up under the truck to\l"
    .string "sleep, as if waiting for someone.\p"
    .string "Perhaps M only wanted to go home.”$"

NewIsland_Text_SailorHeadBack::
    .string "The fog's closing in again.\n"
    .string "Ready to head back to VERMILION?$"

NewIsland_Text_SailorCastOff::
    .string "Right! Hold on tight!$"

NewIsland_Text_SailorWait::
    .string "Take your time. I'll wait\n"
    .string "right here by the boat.$"
